4
00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:10.255
Part four point one ended on a problem.

5
00:00:10.514 --> 00:00:12.159
A plain loop rewrites its whole state

6
00:00:12.159 --> 00:00:14.020
every slot, through U and tanh, so its

7
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:15.665
