32
00:00:56.604 --> 00:00:58.615
Layer two's gates read layer one's h in

33
00:00:58.615 --> 00:00:59.620
place of the guitar.

34
00:00:59.921 --> 00:01:02.032
In our model each layer has a hundred and

35
00:01:02.032 --> 00:01:04.092
twenty-eight of these cells side by side.

36
00:01:07.423 --> 00:01:09.119
The LSTM is built from one simple

37
00:01:09.119 --> 00:01:09.618
operation.

38
00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:11.812
Take two lists of the same length and

39
00:01:11.812 --> 00:01:14.106
multiply them entry by entry: first with

40
00:01:14.106 --> 00:01:15.503
first, second with second.

41
00:01:15.802 --> 00:01:18.046
That's the elementwise product, written as

42
00:01:18.046 --> 00:01:18.944
a dot in a circle.

43
00:01:19.243 --> 00:01:21.288
Here, zero point nine times two is one

44
00:01:21.288 --> 00:01:23.632
point eight; zero point one times five is

45
00:01:23.632 --> 00:01:25.976
zero point five; one times minus three is

46
00:01:25.976 --> 00:01:26.574
minus three.

47
00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:28.741
When the first list is made of numbers

48
00:01:28.741 --> 00:01:30.685
between zero and one, it acts like a gate.

49
00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:32.672
Lesson three point two's sigmoid makes

50
00:01:32.672 --> 00:01:33.600
exactly such numbers.

51
00:01:33.865 --> 00:01:35.720
Multiplied entry by entry, a one lets a

52
00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.531
value through, a zero blocks it, and

53
00:01:37.531 --> 00:01:39.121
anything in between lets some of it

54
00:01:39.121 --> 00:01:39.474
through.

55
00:01:39.739 --> 00:01:41.418
And the gate is not fixed: it is

56
00:01:41.418 --> 00:01:43.273
recomputed at every slot, from what the

57
00:01:43.273 --> 00:01:45.084
layer hears and what it showed last slot.

58
00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.863
The forget gate, f, in exactly the form

59
00:01:50.863 --> 00:01:51.871
PyTorch writes it.

60
00:01:52.207 --> 00:01:53.607
Build it from the inside.

61
00:01:53.943 --> 00:01:56.854
First, what it hears: the input x t, times

62
00:01:56.854 --> 00:01:59.205
a weight, W i f, plus a bias, b i f.

63
00:01:59.541 --> 00:02:01.949
The little i f means from the input, for

64
00:02:01.949 --> 00:02:02.844
the forget gate.

65
00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.812
Then what the layer showed last slot: h t

66
00:02:05.812 --> 00:02:08.387
minus one, times its own weight, W h f,

67
00:02:08.387 --> 00:02:09.451
plus a second bias.

68
00:02:09.787 --> 00:02:12.138
PyTorch keeps two biases, but they only

69
00:02:12.138 --> 00:02:14.378
ever add together, so they act as one.

70
00:02:14.713 --> 00:02:17.345
Then a sigmoid, sigma, squashes the sum to

71
00:02:17.345 --> 00:02:19.864
between zero and one, one number for every

72
00:02:19.864 --> 00:02:20.144
cell.

73
00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.945
In layer one there are five inputs and a

74
00:02:22.945 --> 00:02:25.362
hundred and twenty-eight cells, so W i f

75
00:02:25.362 --> 00:02:27.892
is a hundred and twenty-eight by five, W h

76
00:02:27.892 --> 00:02:30.253
f a hundred and twenty-eight by a hundred

77
00:02:30.253 --> 00:02:32.726
and twenty-eight, and each bias a hundred

78
00:02:32.726 --> 00:02:33.963
and twenty-eight long.

79
00:02:34.464 --> 00:02:35.456
Now a toy, one cell.

80
00:02:35.726 --> 00:02:37.845
The guitar plays an onset, so x is one;

81
00:02:37.845 --> 00:02:39.739
last slot the cell showed zero point five

82
00:02:39.739 --> 00:02:40.325
and held two.

83
00:02:40.596 --> 00:02:42.850
Give the forget gate made-up weights: one,

84
00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:43.842
a half, one, zero.

85
00:02:44.112 --> 00:02:45.871
The sum is one plus a half plus a half

86
00:02:45.871 --> 00:02:46.637
plus zero, two.

87
00:02:46.908 --> 00:02:48.756
Sigmoid of two is zero point eight eight.

88
00:02:49.027 --> 00:02:50.875
So the belt keeps zero point eight eight

89
00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.543
of its two: one point seven six.

90
00:02:55.823 --> 00:02:57.829
Two more pieces decide what goes onto the

91
00:02:57.829 --> 00:02:58.067
belt.

92
00:02:58.354 --> 00:03:00.502
The input gate, i, has the same shape as

93
00:03:00.502 --> 00:03:02.747
