96
00:03:05.611 --> 00:03:07.664
The candidate, g, again the same shape

97
00:03:07.664 --> 00:03:09.956
with its own weights, but with tanh: the

98
00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:11.962
value that could be written, from minus

99
00:03:11.962 --> 00:03:12.487
one to one.

100
00:03:12.931 --> 00:03:14.554
Why the two different squashes?

101
00:03:14.869 --> 00:03:16.963
The gates are fractions, so a sigmoid.

102
00:03:17.277 --> 00:03:19.581
The candidate is a value, and a value may

103
