104
00:03:22.288 --> 00:03:23.317
Back to the toy cell.

105
00:03:23.611 --> 00:03:25.964
The input gate's sum comes to one; sigmoid

106
00:03:25.964 --> 00:03:28.121
of one is zero point seven three one one,

107
00:03:28.121 --> 00:03:29.787
