115
00:03:46.698 --> 00:03:48.721
What's kept: f times the old cell.

116
00:03:49.032 --> 00:03:50.900
Plus what's written: i times g.

117
00:03:51.212 --> 00:03:52.613
That's the new cell, c t.

118
00:03:52.924 --> 00:03:55.362
For the toy: one point seven six two plus

119
00:03:55.362 --> 00:03:57.697
