123
00:04:02.768 --> 00:04:05.157
with its own weights and a sigmoid: how

124
00:04:05.157 --> 00:04:06.537
much of each cell to show.

125
00:04:06.856 --> 00:04:09.245
In the toy its sum is zero, and sigmoid of

126
00:04:09.245 --> 00:04:10.041
