130
00:04:16.275 --> 00:04:18.613
For the toy, a half times tanh of two

131
00:04:18.613 --> 00:04:21.186
point four two three, which is zero point

132
00:04:21.186 --> 00:04:23.934
nine eight four: zero point four nine two.

133
00:04:24.474 --> 00:04:27.224
Forget, input, candidate, output, the new

134
00:04:27.224 --> 00:04:29.699
